'Subject: re : industrials\ni leave this with you . my take is that the situation is as i suspected and\npat wants me to pretty much leave them be . i will do that unless i hear a\ndifferent plan from you .\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - forwarded by kenneth seaman / hou / ect on 01 / 05 / 2000\n08 : 13 am - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\npat clynes @ enron\n01 / 05 / 2000 08 : 08 am\nto : kenneth seaman / hou / ect @ ect\ncc : robert e lloyd / hou / ect @ ect\nsubject : re : industrials\nken ,\ni think robert has a good handle on things and can function on his own . with\nthat said , we always want different\nchecks and balances in place in order to capture the most accurate\ninformation , so if you see something that is\na problem please bring it to our attention . thanks , pat\nkenneth seaman @ ect 01 / 05 / 2000 07 : 23 am\nto : pat clynes / corp / enron @ enron\ncc :\nsubject : re : industrials\ni believe the transition to be complete as we have , at least , been over the\nground on all the subjects . would you like me to continue offering advise\nand assistance or let robert function entirely on his own ?',ham
